      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/reckless/{size}/2467_2.png",
      "created_at": "2013-04-24T21:02:03.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Do we really have to rule away a very specific situation that involves timeshifting a Cloaking Device out of sync with the current timestream, rendering it useless?&nbsp; I mean, that's like houseruling away Fixed Point-ing multiple Styles/Tools for Fixer, or Haka eating the Cloak with Savage Mana.&nbsp; There's game balance, and then there fun policing.</p>",
